ty</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 17.8851%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"136\">\n<p align=\"center\">Head Constable HC (Ministerial)</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 5.02759%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"47\">\n<p align=\"center\">47</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 8.35509%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"63\">\n<p align=\"center\">11</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 8.09399%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"61\">\n<p align=\"center\">26</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 6.13577%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"46\">\n<p align=\"center\">21</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 5.74413%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"43\">\n<p align=\"center\">10</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 9.21849%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"64\">\n<p align=\"center\">115</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 39.0058%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"308\">\n<ul>\n<li>10+2 Intermediate Exam in Any Recognized Board in India.</li>\n<li>English Typing : 35 WPM <b>OR</b> Hindi Typing : 30 WPM</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 99.4659%;\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"766\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Physical Eligibility</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.9127%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"161\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Type</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 32.6786%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"265\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Male</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.8746%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"340\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Female</b></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.9127%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"161\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Racing</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 32.6786%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"265\">\n<p align=\"center\">1.6 KM in 6 Min. 30 Second</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.8746%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"340\">\n<p align=\"center\">800 Meter in 04 Minute.</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.9127%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"161\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Height</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 32.6786%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"265\">\n<p align=\"center\">165 CMS</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.8746%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"340\">\n<p align=\"center\">155 CMS</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.9127%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"161\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Height ST Only</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 32.6786%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"265\">\n<p align=\"center\">162.5 CMS</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.8746%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"340\">\n<p align=\"center\">150 CMS</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 22.9127%;\" colspan=\"2\" valign=\"top\" width=\"161\">\n<p align=\"center\"><b>Chest</b></p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 32.6786%;\" colspan=\"6\" valign=\"top\" width=\"265\">\n<p align=\"center\">77-82 CMS</p>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 43.8746%;\" colspan=\"4\" valign=\"top\" width=\"340\">\n<p align=\"center\">NA</p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 99.4659%;\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"766\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>How to Fill Form</b></span><b></b></h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Sashastra Seema Bal SSB Head Constable HC Ministerial Recruitment 2021, Candidate Can Apply Between <b>24/07/2021 to 22/08/2021.</b></li>\n<li>Candidate Read the Notification Before Apply the Vacancies Application Form in Govt. Jobs of Defense SSB Latest Govt. Recruitment Online 2021.</li>\n<li>Kindly Check and Collect the All Document – Eligibility, ID Proof, Address Details, Basic Details.</li>\n<li>Kindly Ready Scan Document Related to Recruitment Form – Photo, Sign, ID Proof, Etc.</li>\n<li>Before Apply Online / Submit Application Form Must Check the Preview and All Column Carefully.</li>\n<li>If Candidate Required to Paying the Application Fee Must Submit. If you have Not the Required Application Fees Your Form is Not Completed.</li>\n<li>Take A Print Out of Final Submitted Form.</li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 99.4659%;\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"766\"><center><br>\n<!-- Square Sep19 300x250 --><br>\n<br>\n</center><p></p>\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Enrolled Candidate Can Download Admit Card.</b></span><b> </b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 99.4659%;\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"766\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 62.5208%;\" colspan=\"11\" valign=\"top\" width=\"484\">\n\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 36.9452%;\" valign=\"top\" width=\"282\">\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 99.4659%;\" colspan=\"12\" valign=\"top\" width=\"766\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><b>Some Useful Important Links</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 57.9887%;\" colspan=\"9\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download CBT Exam Notice</b></span></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 41.4773%;\" colspan=\"3\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"434\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download PET/PST Admit Card</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"332\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"Admit Card for SSB HC Ministerial Exam 2021\" href=\"https://applyssb.com/ssb_hcmin_pet_admitcardsv1/applicationHome\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Click Here </b></a></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 57.9887%;\" colspan=\"9\" valign=\"top\" width=\"434\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #ff00ff;\"><b>Download Admit Card</b></span><b></b></h2>\n</td>\n<td style=\"width: 41.4773%;\" colspan=\"3\" valign=\"top\" width=\"332\">\n<h2 align=\"center\"><a title=\"Admit Card for SSB HC Ministerial Exam 2021\" href=\"https://applyssb.com/SSBDMEAdmitcard/applicationAfterIndex\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><b>Cl